            <value>•&lt;fontsize 12> &lt;/> Bank account management&lt;fontsize 14>&lt;/>directly from 1C:Enterprise 8 
• High&lt;fontsize 14>&lt;/>speed of data exchange with bank
• Increased&lt;fontsize 14> &lt;/>security level</value>
          </title>
